<Layout
	title="About & CV"
	description="Since Wikipedia won't accept my bribes..."
	pubDate={new Date("Oct 11 2026")}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	
<center><i>(Image from MIT Technology Review, <a href="https://archive.ph/kJD2R" target="_blank"
		rel="noopener noreferrer">available here.</a>)</i></center>

<br>
	<center><h2>Work & Responsibilities</h2></center>

	<p>
		Hi folks, I am an aging millenial whose biggest fear in life is being
		called a "poser" by my younger self.
	</p>

	<p>
		I have an unhealthy obsession with all technologies, including police
		surveillance. I am an national expert on police surveillance and my work
		has been covered extensively. My tips and primary source documents into
		Clearview AI because the basis for <a
			href="https://web.archive.org/web/20200630164223/https://www.nytimes.com/2020/01/20/reader-center/insider-clearview-ai.html"
			>The New York Times' front-page coverage</a
		> of the company and lead to international outrage, including millions of
		dollars of fines levied against the company and lawsuits all over the world.
		As retaliation, the company attempted to <a
			href="https://www.politico.com/news/2021/09/24/clearview-ai-subpoena-watchdog-groups-514273"
			>subpoena me multiple times to reveal my records and sourcing.</a
		>
	</p>

	<p>
		Of course, a large part of my work is focused on Chicago and has been
		covered by places like the <a
			href="https://chicago.suntimes.com/crime/2026/08/27/flock-license-plate-reader-alpr-chicago-suburb"
			>Chicago Sun-Times</a
		>. My original writings can be found in places like <a
			href="https://www.404media.co/facial-recognition-company-clearview-attempted-to-buy-social-security-numbers-and-mugshots-for-its-database/"
			>404Media</a
		>, <a
			href="https://truthout.org/articles/ice-kidnapped-my-neighbor-in-broad-daylight-the-aftermath-left-me-reeling/"
			>Truthout</a
		>, and <a
			href="https://www.thenation.com/article/politics/doj-trump-espionage-act/"
			>The Nation</a
		> among others. It also means I often talk to politicians, local organizers,
		criminal defense attorneys, members of the public, classrooms, or at conferences.
	</p>

	<p>
		<strike
			><b
				>If you want to retain me as an expert witness about police
				surveillance technologies under Rule 26 or on the local level, <a
					href="mailto:expert@bmeson.style,mailto:freddy@lucyparsonslabs.com"
					>email me.</a
				></b
			></strike
		>
		<br />I am currently on sabbatical.
	</p>
	<p>
		I am a co-founder and staff worker at the <a
			href="https://lucyparsonslabs.com/"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener noreferrer">Lucy Parsons Labs</a
		> which we established over 11 years ago. I have also worked on issues of
		government transparency, classification reform, the Freedom of Information
		Act, and other projects. I previously was a software and security engineer
		and studied physics.
	</p>

